              "solution_quote": "- Statement I is false. The vertical asymptotes of the function are integer multiples of $\\pi $, i.e., $x=n\\pi .$\n\n- Statement II is false. The domain of the function is all real numbers except the values where the asymptotes occur, i.e., $x=n\\pi .$\n\n- Statement III is true. The period of $y=cot⁡x$ is $\\pi .$",
              "matches_worked_solution": true,
              "choice_present": true
            }
          }
        ],
