              "solution_quote": "\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & =0\\cdot f(0)+1\\cdot f(1)+2\\cdot f(2)+3\\cdot f(3)+4\\cdot f(5)+5\\cdot f(5) \\\\  & =0(\\frac{1}{6})+1(\\frac{1}{6})+2(\\frac{1}{6})+3(\\frac{1}{6})+4(\\frac{1}{6})+5(\\frac{1}{6}) \\\\  & =0+\\frac{1}{6}+\\frac{2}{6}+\\frac{3}{6}+\\frac{4}{6}+\\frac{5}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{0+1+2+3+4+5}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{15}{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{2}.\\end{aligned}",
