              "source_file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082768/state.json",
              "solution_quote": "The intersection of all these rectangles is the line segment $\\{0\\}\\times [0,1]:$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14082768/assets/704f8f6f0666d09bb2b8a25eab0548c3eb808e2c9d394d2ae873de35cb0112d1.png)",
